Z||000000||Aero||04-01-99||01:49 PM||||Have an 84 Fiero, it just stopped running. The ECM won't go into Diagnostic mode The injector has power and works, It will run if you squirt fuel in, and Electrically it will run
Z||000001||Shipbuilder||04-05-99||07:10 PM||||I bought my first Fiero two months ago and had the same problem. It would run if I poured gas into the throttle body. I checked the fuel pump first and it was fine. Only other choice was the injector. I replaced it and the engine ran like a top.
